#### ❌ #10. **Provider 命名不一致** [未修复]
**问题位置**: `lib/providers/` 目录

**修复状态**: ❌ **未修复**

**问题描述**:
- 有些用 Service 后缀，有些用 Repository 后缀，有些直接用功能名
- 影响代码可读性

**优化方案**:
```dart
// 统一命名规范：
// 1. Service/Repository 实例: xxxServiceProvider / xxxRepositoryProvider
// 2. 数据 Provider: xxxProvider
// 3. 状态 Provider: xxxStateProvider

// Service 层
final audioPlayerServiceProvider = Provider<AudioPlayerService>(...);
final subsonicServiceProvider = Provider<SubsonicService>(...);

// Repository 层
final musicRepositoryProvider = Provider<MusicRepository>(...);

// 数据层
final currentSongProvider = StreamProvider<Song?>(...);
final starredSongsProvider = FutureProvider<List<Song>>(...);

// 状态层
final playModeStateProvider = StateProvider<PlayMode>(...);
final serverConfigStateProvider = StateProvider<ServerConfig?>(...);
```

**优先级**: 🔷 低（不影响功能，但影响代码可读性）
**问题位置**: `lib/providers/audio_player_provider.dart:36-42`, `lib/services/audio_player_service.dart`

**问题描述**:
- `AudioPlayerService` 是可变单例，`audioPlayerServiceProvider` 是普通 `Provider`，状态变化不会触发订阅者刷新
- UI 通过 `ref.listen(currentSongProvider, ...)` 空回调"尝试刷新"，实际不会触发重建
- `MiniPlayer` 与 `PlayerScreen` 直接读 `audioService.currentSong`，歌曲切换可能不更新
- 播放队列/播放模式同时在服务内部与 `StateProvider` (`currentPlaylistProvider` / `currentIndexProvider` / `playModeProvider`) 维护，容易产生漂移

**代码示例**:
```dart
// Provider 中的状态
final currentPlaylistProvider = StateProvider<List<Song>>((ref) => []);
final currentIndexProvider = StateProvider<int>((ref) => -1);
final playModeProvider = StateProvider<PlayMode>((ref) => PlayMode.sequence);

// Service 中的状态（重复！）
class AudioPlayerService {
  List<Song> _playlist = [];
  int _currentIndex = -1;
  PlayMode _playMode = PlayMode.sequence;
}
```

**问题影响**:
- ❌ **双重状态源**: Provider 和 Service 各自维护状态，容易不同步
- ❌ **数据一致性风险**: 修改播放队列时需要同时更新两处
- ❌ **难以维护**: 新开发者不知道该信任哪个状态源

**优化方案 A（推荐）**: Service 作为唯一状态源
```dart
// 1. 在 AudioPlayerService 中暴露 Stream
class AudioPlayerService {
  final _playlistController = StreamController<List<Song>>.broadcast();
  final _indexController = StreamController<int>.broadcast();
  final _playModeController = StreamController<PlayMode>.broadcast();

  Stream<List<Song>> get playlistStream => _playlistController.stream;
  Stream<int> get indexStream => _indexController.stream;
  Stream<PlayMode> get playModeStream => _playModeController.stream;

  void setPlaylist(List<Song> songs, {int initialIndex = 0}) {
    _playlist = songs;
    _currentIndex = initialIndex;
    _playlistController.add(_playlist);
    _indexController.add(_currentIndex);
  }
}

// 2. Provider 从 Service 的 Stream 获取状态
final currentPlaylistProvider = StreamProvider<List<Song>>((ref) {
  final service = ref.watch(audioPlayerServiceProvider);
  return service.playlistStream;
});

final currentIndexProvider = StreamProvider<int>((ref) {
  final service = ref.watch(audioPlayerServiceProvider);
  return service.indexStream;
});
```

**优化方案 B**: 使用 StateNotifier 完全由 Riverpod 管理
```dart
class PlaybackState {
  final List<Song> playlist;
  final int currentIndex;
  final PlayMode playMode;
  final Song? currentSong;

  PlaybackState({
    this.playlist = const [],
    this.currentIndex = -1,
    this.playMode = PlayMode.sequence,
    this.currentSong,
  });

  PlaybackState copyWith({
    List<Song>? playlist,
    int? currentIndex,
    PlayMode? playMode,
    Song? currentSong,
  }) => PlaybackState(
    playlist: playlist ?? this.playlist,
    currentIndex: currentIndex ?? this.currentIndex,
    playMode: playMode ?? this.playMode,
    currentSong: currentSong ?? this.currentSong,
  );
}

class PlaybackNotifier extends StateNotifier<PlaybackState> {
  final AudioPlayerService _audioService;

  PlaybackNotifier(this._audioService) : super(PlaybackState());

  Future<void> setPlaylist(List<Song> songs, {int initialIndex = 0}) async {
    state = state.copyWith(
      playlist: songs,
      currentIndex: initialIndex,
    );
    await _audioService.setPlaylist(songs, initialIndex: initialIndex);
  }

  Future<void> playSong(int index, String streamUrl) async {
    final song = state.playlist[index];
    state = state.copyWith(currentIndex: index, currentSong: song);
    await _audioService.playSong(song, streamUrl);
  }
}

final playbackProvider = StateNotifierProvider<PlaybackNotifier, PlaybackState>((ref) {
  final audioService = ref.watch(audioPlayerServiceProvider);
  return PlaybackNotifier(audioService);
});
```

