#### 10. **Provider 命名不一致**
**问题位置**: `lib/providers/` 目录

**优化方案**:
```dart
// 统一命名规范：
// 1. Service/Repository 实例: xxxServiceProvider / xxxRepositoryProvider
// 2. 数据 Provider: xxxProvider
// 3. 状态 Provider: xxxStateProvider

// Service 层
final audioPlayerServiceProvider = Provider<AudioPlayerService>(...);
final subsonicServiceProvider = Provider<SubsonicService>(...);

// Repository 层
final musicRepositoryProvider = Provider<MusicRepository>(...);

// 数据层
final currentSongProvider = StreamProvider<Song?>(...);
final starredSongsProvider = FutureProvider<List<Song>>(...);

// 状态层
final playModeStateProvider = StateProvider<PlayMode>(...);
final serverConfigStateProvider = StateProvider<ServerConfig?>(...);
```

